      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It's easy to abuse orange status and become antisocial\nPeople say they stay in orange status for \"safety\" but its easy to lock your new friends off and pretend \"if they want to join, just ask\" and then pretend \"I dont know them enough, i'm going to pretend i didnt see that\"",
